# 💳 LoanEase
### AI-Powered Loan Eligibility & Recommendation Platform

> An intelligent fintech platform that leverages Machine Learning to predict loan eligibility, estimate approval probability, and provide personalized financial recommendations through an interactive analytics dashboard.

